lg:MT-SL-378-18-r14-1-q1
    a lgo:Quote ;
    lgo:officialLanguageVersion true ;
    lgo:quoteOf lg:MT-SL-378-18-r14-1 ;
    lgo:retrievedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:MT-SL-378-18-source ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/law/section[1]/paragraph[1]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://legislation.mt/eli/sl/378.18/eng"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lgo:text """(1) A trader shall inform consumers about the ADR entity by which he is covered, when he commits to or is obliged to use such an entity to resolve disputes with consumers:
Provided that such information shall include the website address of the relevant ADR entity and shall be provided in a clear, comprehensible and easily accessible way on the trader’s website, where one exists, and, if applicable, in the general terms and conditions of sales or service contracts between the trader and the consumer."""@en .

